.TH REGEL-HARNESS 1 "September 2026" "regel-screensaver 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
regel-harness \- Interactive developer test harness and previewer for Regel screensaver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regel-harness
[\fIQML_OPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBregel-harness\fR launches the interactive developer testing and preview harness
for the Regel wallpaper and screensaver suite on KDE Plasma 6. It allows real-time
switching between all 7 procedural visual archetypes, live audio spectrum monitoring,
and simulated screensaver authentication lifecycle events.
.SH KEYBOARD CONTROLS
.TP
\fB1\-7\fR
Switch active visual archetype (Liquid Neon Abyss, Living Petri Dish, Tranquil Sanctuary, Cosmic Sandbox, Synthwave Megacity, Ephemeris Biome, Kinetic Spiderweb Harp).
.TP
\fBF\fR
Toggle full-screen preview mode.
.TP
\fBEsc\fR
Exit previewer.
